    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "dCndw",
      "x": 2263,
      "y": 7486,
      "name": "Motion note · Pipecat stage",
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "#FFF7D6",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZbOGV",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "content": "Motion · Pipecat ⇄ Fonoster stage",
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TIUC5",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Play the lane as a live call: messages appear one by one (≈600 ms apart), sliding in from the side that sends them, then loop after a pause.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "neKAR",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• media rows: small dots travel along a wire between the two cards in the message's direction; inbound dots are steady, outbound dots pulse with the agent's speech.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "x9vvQi",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Barge-in beat: on “Actually—” the outbound dots freeze, clear flashes once, queued dots fade out, then mark reply-1 echoes back. This is the money shot.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "s8Fut",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• dtmf 5: a keypad digit pops on the Fonoster card and travels to Pipecat.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZFaE4",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• stop: wire dims, both cards settle; restart after 3 s.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g82Wy",
          "name": "Point",
          "fill": "#3A2E00",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Pause when off screen; prefers-reduced-motion shows the static stage exactly as designed. Colors never change (same rule as the dot-grid wave).",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
